# The upgraded Fremennik rings are Anachronia-only in Equilibrium.
#
# Base game, these are a two-region craft: a heart from the Rex Matriarchs on
# Anachronia combined with ten of the matching Fremennik ring from the Dagannoth
# Kings. The League changes the drop - "Rex Matriarchs - Will drop full
# Fremennik rings instead of the hearts" - so a self-supplying player needs
# Anachronia and nothing else. The Fremennik requirement, the combine step and
# the heart come off all four rings.
#
# Occultist's ring already sat on anachronia alone and is left as it is.
#
# The Channeller's ring was also held twice. The 2026-07-31 same-region dedupe
# merged anachronia:channellers-ring into cross-region:channellers-ring, but
# that id names a cross-region requirement that no longer exists. The item:
# record survives instead and takes the passive, the wiki's two-l spelling and
# the two effect notes worth keeping; the id-shaped commentary is dropped.
